Scoped Apple Core Audio Format (CAF) muxer

The caff file header, desc, chan, info and data chunks in src/caf.ts follow
libavformat/cafenc.c (codec_flags, samples_per_packet, caf_write_init,
caf_write_header, caf_write_trailer), the PCM and G.711 rows of
ff_codec_caf_tags in libavformat/caf.c, and mov_channel_layout and
ff_mov_write_chan in libavformat/isom.c.
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
